.TH AUDIOCONTROL_MIGRATE_PLAYERS 1 "August 2026" "audiocontrol" "AudioControl Utilities"
.SH NAME
audiocontrol_migrate_players \- migrate player definitions from legacy config
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B audiocontrol_migrate_players
\fICONFIG\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B audiocontrol_migrate_players
migrates player definitions from a legacy
.B audiocontrol.json
file into the
.B players.d
layout used by newer AudioControl versions.
.PP
The command is primarily intended for package upgrade workflows.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I CONFIG
Path to the legacy AudioControl configuration file (typically
.I /etc/audiocontrol/audiocontrol.json
).
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success and non-zero on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR audiocontrol (1)
.SH AUTHORS
HiFiBerry AudioControl development team.
